hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"883","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Banu Uzra mein se aik mard ne, aik riwayat ke izafay ke mutabiq Ansaar mein se jisay Abu Mazkoor kaha jata hai, apna aik ghulam apne marnay ke baad azaad honay ki shart par (mudabbar) azaad kiya, doosri riwayat mein hai ke usay Yaqub kaha jata hai. To ye baat Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko pahunchi to Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumharay paas is ke siwa koi maal hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi. To Aap ne farmaya: Kaun isay mujh se khareedtay hai? To Nuaim bin Abdullah Adawi ne usay aath sau dirham mein khareed liya, phir wo (qeemat) Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laya aur Aap ko ada ki. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Apni zaat se shuru karo aur us par sadqa karo, phir agar kuch bach jaye to tumharay ghar walon ke liye hai, phir agar tumharay ghar walon se kuch bach jaye to tumharay rishtadar ke liye hai, phir agar tumharay rishtadar se kuch bach jaye to yun aur yun. Aap farmatay thay: Apne saamnay, apne daaein aur apne baaein (kharch karo). (Muslim: 3/78-79). Baab: Ghulamon ke kharch aur un ka khana rok rakh nay walay ke gunah ke baaray mein. (Riwayat ke izafay Sahih Muslim se hain.)"
"884","[AI-translation] Khaisama se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) ke saath baithay hue thay ke un ke paas un ka khazanchi aaya, to wo dakhil hua aur (Ibn Amr ne) kaha: Kya tum ne ghulamon ko un ka khana de diya? Us ne kaha: Nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Jao aur unhein (khana) de do. Unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ke liye itna gunah kaafi hai ke wo jis ke khanay ka maalik hai us se us ka khana rok le. (Muslim: 3/78). Baab: Ghar walon par kharch ki fazilat. (Qahrammaan Farsi zuban mein khazanchi aur wakeel aur kaarinday ko kehtay hain.)"
"885","[AI-translation] Sauban (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Sab se afzal deenaar jo aadmi kharch karta hai wo deenaar hai jisay apne ghar walon par kharch karta hai, is liye ke baaz un mein se aisay hain jin ka kharcha farz hai jaisay choti aulad. Aur usi tarah wo deenaar jisay apne janwar par Allah ki raah mein kharch karta hai, yani jihad mein. Aur wo deenaar jisay apne rafeeqon par Allah ki raah mein kharch karta hai. Abu Qilaba ne kaha ke Aap ne ghar walon se shuru kiya. Phir Abu Qilaba ne kaha ke us se barh kar kis ka sawab hai jo apne chotay bachon par kharch karta hai, ya Allah Taala un ko us ke sabab se kisi ke aagay haath phailanay se bacha de ya nafa de aur un ko ghani kar de. (Muslim). (Baaz alfaz Sahih Muslim ke izafay hain.)"
"886","[AI-translation] Abu Mas'ud Badri (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Musalman jab apne ghar walon par kharch karay aur wo us par sawab ki niyyat rakhta ho to wo us ke liye sadqa hai. (Muslim: 3/81). Baab: Aurat ka apne shohar ke maal se dastoor ke mutabiq us ke bachon par kharch karna."
"887","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hind Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Allah ki qasam! Zameen ki peeth par kisi khaimay walay itnay pasandeeda na thay ke Allah unhein zaleel karay jitnay Aap ke khaimay walay, aur zameen ki peeth par kisi khaimay walay itnay pasandeeda na hain ke Allah unhein izzat de jitnay Aap ke khaimay walay. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aur bhi (tumhara ye jazba badhega), us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai. Phir us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak Abu Sufyan kanjoos aadmi hai, to kya mujh par koi haraj hai ke main us ke maal se us ke bachon par us ki ijazat ke baghair kharch karun? To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum par koi haraj nahi ke tum dastoor ke mutabiq un par kharch karo. (Muslim: 5/130). Baab: Teen talaq wali (aurat) ke liye na kharcha hai."
"888","[AI-translation] Fatima bint Qais (raziyallahu anha) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se, teen talaq wali (aurat) ke baaray mein riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Us ke liye na rehaish hai aur na kharcha. (Muslim: 4/198)"
"889","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Fatima ke liye is baat ke zikr karnay mein koi khair nahi, yani us ka qaul ke na rehaish hai aur na kharcha. (Muslim: 4/200)"
"890","[AI-translation] Abu Ishaq se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Aswad bin Yazid ke saath bari masjid mein baitha hua tha aur hamaray saath Sha'bi thay, to Sha'bi ne Fatima bint Qais ki hadees bayan ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ke liye na rehaish muqarrar ki aur na kharcha, phir Aswad ne kankariyon se aik mutthi li aur usay us se maara aur kaha: Tera bura ho, tum aisi baat bayan kartay ho? Umar ne kaha: Ham Allah ki kitab aur apne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki sunnat ko aik aurat ke qaul ki wajah se nahi chhortein jis ke baaray mein ham nahi jantay ke shayad us ne yaad rakha ya bhool gayi. Us ke liye rehaish aur kharcha hai. Allah Taala ne farmaya: Unhein un ke gharon se na nikalo aur na wo niklein siwae is ke ke wo khuli behayai karein. (Muslim: 4/198)"
